1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,906
Merozoites burst out and invade red blood cells.

2
00:00:03,906 --> 00:00:15,755
Inside each cell the parasite grows, divides, and every forty eight hours the red cells burst together, releasing new merozoites and toxins.

3
00:00:15,755 --> 00:00:23,684
That synchronised bursting is the fever: a cold stage with shivering, a hot stage, then sweating.

4
00:00:23,684 --> 00:00:26,575
Every third day: tertian malaria.

